        "text": "I had an outstanding experience working with Erik Dufresne. From our very first meeting, he was professional, knowledgeable, and incredibly attentive to my needs. Erik made the entire process — from searching for the perfect home to closing the deal — smooth and stress-free.\n\nHe truly listened to what I was looking for, provided valuable insights about the market, and was always available to answer my questions, no matter how small. His negotiation skills were impressive, and I always felt like he had my best interests at heart.\n\nThanks to Erik Dufresne, I found the perfect home and couldn’t be happier. I highly recommend him to anyone looking for a dedicated and trustworthy real estate agent!",
